# fdfpv-rooms@.service: the rooms server (edge/rooms/node.js) on the VM,
# one instance per port, fdfpv-rooms@8797 and fdfpv-rooms@8798. A deploy
# (rooms-deploy.sh, docs/ROOMS-DRAIN.md) starts the new version as the
# instance not live, points Caddy at it and tells the live one to drain:
# its rooms fly on until they empty or its 20 minute cap. Installed into
# /etc/systemd/system by rooms-deploy.sh; the live port is in
# /etc/fdfpv/rooms-live. ADMIN_SECRET,
# the key to GET /v2/admin/health (edge/rooms/health.js), is the tracks
# server's, from the same root only file: one secret for the owner to hold.
#
